[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0010","text":"小甜……现在……方便吗……？\n甜花，有事想跟……小甜商量……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0020","text":"嗯，当然没问题☆\n什么都可以跟我说哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0030","text":"其实甜花……\n有喜欢的人了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0040","text":"…………！？！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0050","text":"（诶诶……！！　怎么会，甜花酱她……喜欢上了别人……\n　可、可是恋爱是美好的事情，我得支持她才行……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0060","text":"是、是这样啊……\n是个什么样的人……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0070","text":"那个……呃……\n是、是帅哥……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0080","text":"（看脸——！？！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0090","text":"不行哦甜花酱，不能只看外表就决定……！\n内在也很重要，要会珍惜甜花酱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0100","text":"好～，谢谢大家……！！\n整蛊大成功！！　甘奈小姐和甜花小姐都太棒了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400500_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
